Package: d3poindia
Title: BharatViz: India State Context Maps
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Rahul",
           family = "Shukla",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "rahulshuklakrc@gmail.com")
Description: BharatViz visualises published, aggregate state-level indicators for
    India as descriptive regional context. Two separate layers: health/education
    context (National Family Health Survey, NFHS-5, 2019-21) and factory-sector
    productivity & pay (Annual Survey of Industries, ASI 2023-24, current prices).
    It ships no microdata. Part of the Growth & Work Atlas; the layers are shown
    separately and are not joined to each other, and differences are descriptive,
    not causal. Built with the D3po framework.
